config MINET
	tristate "Xiaomi minet flow monitor and idle notifications"
	depends on NETFILTER && NF_CONNTRACK && INET && IPV6
	depends on PM_SLEEP && ANDROID_VENDOR_OEM_DATA
	help
	  Reconstructs the stock minet Generic Netlink, flow accounting and
	  wlan0 idle notification contracts (rodin blob 6.6.77-android15).
	  Stock defects are deliberately retained; changing behavior breaks
	  the userspace minetd contract.
